    <item>
      <title>shed</title>
      <description>soltar, perder, desfazer-se de (folhas, peso, empregos); em &quot;shed light on&quot;, esclarecer, lançar luz sobre (irregular: shed / shed / shed)

&quot;The report sheds light on how much food is wasted every year.&quot;

[general]</description>
      <enclosure url="https://arnaldopinhoni.github.io/tv-feed/cards/shed.png" type="image/png" length="0"/>
      <media:thumbnail url="https://arnaldopinhoni.github.io/tv-feed/cards/shed.png"/>
