    <item>
      <title>out of kilter</title>
      <description>desregulado, desequilibrado, fora do prumo; &quot;throw (something) out of kilter&quot; = desajustar, tirar do eixo (variante: &quot;off kilter&quot;)

&quot;One bad join can throw the whole data model out of kilter.&quot;

[expression]</description>
      <enclosure url="https://arnaldopinhoni.github.io/tv-feed/cards/out-of-kilter.png" type="image/png" length="0"/>
      <media:thumbnail url="https://arnaldopinhoni.github.io/tv-feed/cards/out-of-kilter.png"/>
      <media:content url="https://arnaldopinhoni.github.io/tv-feed/cards/out-of-kilter.png" medium="image"/>
      <pubDate>Sat, 14 Nov 2026 02:14:48 GMT</pubDate>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">vocab-out-of-kilter</guid>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>blob</title>
      <description>bolota, massa disforme e sem estrutura (&quot;one big blob of data&quot; = um amontoado de dados sem forma); em TI, BLOB (binary large object) é um dado binário grande guardado como um bloco só, como no Azure Blob Storage

&quot;The raw files land in blob storage before any processing.&quot;

[tech]</description>
      <enclosure url="https://arnaldopinhoni.github.io/tv-feed/cards/blob.png" type="image/png" length="0"/>
      <media:thumbnail url="https://arnaldopinhoni.github.io/tv-feed/cards/blob.png"/>
      <media:content url="https://arnaldopinhoni.github.io/tv-feed/cards/blob.png" medium="image"/>
      <pubDate>Sat, 14 Nov 2026 02:13:48 GMT</pubDate>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">vocab-blob</guid>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>for the sake of</title>
      <description>em prol de, por causa de, só para fins de (&quot;for the sake of argument&quot; = só para argumentar; &quot;for the sake of simplicity&quot; = para simplificar); não confundir com o saquê, que se pronuncia /ˈsɑːkeɪ/

&quot;Let’s ignore taxes, just for the sake of simplicity.&quot;

[expression]</description>
      <enclosure url="https://arnaldopinhoni.github.io/tv-feed/cards/for-the-sake-of.png" type="image/png" length="0"/>
